		<string text="Friendly fire and team balance, for this game."/>
		<string text="Anyone can see and join your game: it is listed\nfor everyone through the brokers."/>
		<string text="Only players with your invite link can join."/>
		<string text="Players from the Server Browser must type it to\njoin (an invite link needs none). Enter sets it."/>
		<string text="Sending players who join without the game's\nCustom Edition map the map, and how fast."/>
		<string text="Listed for everyone through the brokers, and on\nthe master servers with your publisher key."/>
